+Actual Dictionary §§6.1/6.5–6.7 uses broader umbrella wording: Element represents a category, Category is a grouping represented by an Element, Value is assigned to a document/context, and Assignment associates one or more applicable Elements. This edition adopts the qualified working distinctions from current Concepts/Model and maps those actual peer uses without claiming a completed terminology merger, universal one-to-one relationship or accepted full schema.
